# 📁 .gitignore (Root Folder)

# Frontend Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/

# Backend Compiled Files & Binaries
**/bin/
**/obj/
.config/

# User-Specific/OS Environment Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.user
*.suo

# IDE/Editor Configs
.vscode/
.idea/

# ⚠️ SENSITIVE DEVELOPMENT LOGS/CREDS (Optional, if you wish to block local secrets later)
# **/appsettings.Development.json